    "created_at": "2021-03-31T10:16:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-03-31T10:16:24Z",
    "body": "That matches my understanding, though which document \"the document\" is depends on how the `Worker` constructor was invoked.\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/workers.html#dom-worker\r\n\r\n> Let *outside settings* be the [current settings object](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#current-settings-object).\r\n\r\nI'll try to submit a test for this today for COEP report for worker, but essentially, the environment settings object that the `Worker` constructor algorithm uses for parsing *scriptURL* is the same as the one that should be used for the COEP report.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
